{"id":"db01fac30d0e9c8c","group":"93","path":"93/93-lem-stone-dual.md","title":"Stone Dual","display":"Stone Dual","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-lem-stone-dual","aliases":["93-lem-stone-dual"],"display":"Stone Dual","authors":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi","book_title":"Algebraizable Logics","depends_on":["[[93-df-stone-dual]]","[[93-df-isomorphism]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-lem-stone-dual"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-lem-stone-dual</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Stone Dual"},{"key":"authors","html":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi"},{"key":"book_title","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"29bf786772c49a4b\" href=\"?note=29bf786772c49a4b\" title=\"93-df-stone-dual\">93-df-stone-dual</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fe06c83d404633c2\" href=\"?note=fe06c83d404633c2\" title=\"93-df-isomorphism\">93-df-isomorphism</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"lem-stone-dual---Stone-Dual\">lem-stone-dual - Stone Dual</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf B\">\\(\\mathbf B\\)</span> is a Boolean-algebra candidate in the indexed-operation encoding of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"757a95a2c335d9fb\" href=\"?note=757a95a2c335d9fb\" title=\"93-df-boolalg\">93-df-boolalg</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_{\\mathbf B}\">\\(X_{\\mathbf B}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T_{\\mathbf B}\">\\(\\mathcal T_{\\mathbf B}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClopAlg}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{ClopAlg}_{93}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta_{\\mathbf B}\">\\(\\eta_{\\mathbf B}\\)</span> are the canonical constructions of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"29bf786772c49a4b\" href=\"?note=29bf786772c49a4b\" title=\"93-df-stone-dual\">93-df-stone-dual</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BooleanAlg}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{BooleanAlg}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StoneSpace}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{StoneSpace}_{93}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Iso}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Iso}_{93}\\)</span> have their source signatures.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}stone\\text{-}dual}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BooleanAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf B)\\to{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{StoneSpace}_{93}(X_{\\mathbf B},\\mathcal T_{\\mathbf B})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Iso}_{93}\\!\\left(\n\\eta_{\\mathbf B},\\mathbf B,\n\\mathrm{ClopAlg}_{93}(X_{\\mathbf B},\\mathcal T_{\\mathbf B})\n\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}stone\\text{-}dual}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BooleanAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf B)\\to{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{StoneSpace}_{93}(X_{\\mathbf B},\\mathcal T_{\\mathbf B})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Iso}_{93}\\!\\left(\n\\eta_{\\mathbf B},\\mathbf B,\n\\mathrm{ClopAlg}_{93}(X_{\\mathbf B},\\mathcal T_{\\mathbf B})\n\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>The ultrafilter space, generated topology, clopen-set algebra, and canonical map are all bound by the supporting definition.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"lem-stone-dual---Stone-Dual","text":"lem-stone-dual - Stone Dual","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-stone-dual","status":"resolved","id":"29bf786772c49a4b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-stone-dual]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-isomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"fe06c83d404633c2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-isomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-boolalg","status":"resolved","id":"757a95a2c335d9fb","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf B$ is a Boolean-algebra candidate in the indexed-operation encoding of [[93-df-boolalg]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-stone-dual","status":"resolved","id":"29bf786772c49a4b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X_{\\mathbf B}$, $\\mathcal T_{\\mathbf B}$, $\\mathrm{ClopAlg}_{93}$, and $\\eta_{\\mathbf B}$ are the canonical constructions of [[93-df-stone-dual]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf B","display":false},{"tex":"X_{\\mathbf B}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal T_{\\mathbf B}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ClopAlg}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta_{\\mathbf B}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BooleanAlg}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{StoneSpace}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Iso}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}stone\\text{-}dual}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BooleanAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf B)\\to{}&\n\\mathrm{StoneSpace}_{93}(X_{\\mathbf B},\\mathcal T_{\\mathbf B})\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{Iso}_{93}\\!\\left(\n\\eta_{\\mathbf B},\\mathbf B,\n\\mathrm{ClopAlg}_{93}(X_{\\mathbf B},\\mathcal T_{\\mathbf B})\n\\right).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1167,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["29bf786772c49a4b","fe06c83d404633c2","757a95a2c335d9fb"]}